Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.18,0:00:23.54,opjp,,0,0,0,,{\3c&6464EB&\blur3\fad(100,100)}一か八かでいいじゃん
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.54,0:00:26.74,opjp,,0,0,0,,{\3c&6464EB&\blur3\fad(100,100)}そう君は既に虜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.74,0:00:30.29,opjp,,0,0,0,,{\3c&6464EB&\blur3\fad(100,100)}認めたら楽になれるのに
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.29,0:00:31.98,opjp,,0,0,0,,{\3c&38918F&\blur3\fad(100,100)}気まぐれな空模様
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.98,0:00:33.16,opjp,,0,0,0,,{\3c&38918F&\blur3\fad(100,100)}理不尽な世の中
